Stereo tools (src/audio/stereotools.ts)

src/audio/stereotools.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_stereotools.c: the
AVOption table (names, defaults, ranges and the mode and bmode constants of
level_in/out, balance_in/out, softclip, mutel/muter, phasel/phaser, mode,
slev, sbal, mlev, mpan, base, delay, sclevel, phase, bmode_in and bmode_out),
query_formats (a single packed dbl format and the stereo layout),
config_input (the FFALIGN((sample_rate + 9) / 10, 2) ring) and the
per-sample loop of filter_frame, including the ring position carried across
frames and the nbuf truncation to an even sample count.

